<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3751] Interpreter Binding menu of note only shows default interpreter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3751</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In latest master branch (0.9.0-SNAPSHOT) the interpreter binding menu of a note doesn&apos;t list any other interpreter but the default one.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When creating a note I can select between various interpreters.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12961141/12961141_screenshot_Selection_146.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However in the interpreter binding menu of the note only the default interpreter is shown.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12961142/12961142_screenshot_Selection_147.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Our endusers in &amp;lt; 0.9.0 are used to only define %pyspark in every paragraph and adjust the desired default interpreter in the binding menu at runtime from time to time. (e.g. select Spark Interpreter with different sizing). This isn&apos;t possible anymore in 0.9.0. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
